# Next.js

- Use the App Router (`app/`). Prefer Server Components; add `"use client"` only when needed (hooks, events, browser APIs).
- Put pages/layouts in `app/`, UI in `components/`, shared helpers in `lib/`, static data in `constants/`.
- Import with `@/` (e.g. `@/components/header`).
- Style with Tailwind. Reuse `components/ui` and `cn()` from `@/lib/utils`.
- Use `next/image` and `next/link` instead of raw `<img>` / `<a>` for internal routes.
- Load fonts via `next/font` in `app/layout.tsx`. Export `metadata` (or `generateMetadata`) from layouts/pages.
- API handlers live in `app/api/**/route.ts`. Validate input (Zod) and return typed `Response`/`NextResponse`.
- Keep components small and colocated; avoid prop-drilling shared UI into the layout when a local section component is enough.
- Do not add `useMemo`/`useCallback` unless profiling shows a need. Prefer clear, readable code.
